      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "HOW TO USE\n\n1. In \"Load Image\", click \"choose file to upload\" and pick your character picture.\n   (Works best on one anime-style character, full body or upper body.)\n2. Press the blue \"Run\" button at the top.\n3. Wait. The FIRST run downloads about 13 GB of models (see the black console window),\n   after that a picture takes about 5 to 15 minutes depending on the graphics card.\n4. When it is done, the right-hand node shows all the layers.\n   - \"Download PSD\" saves a layered PSD file to your Downloads folder.\n   - The PNG layers, previews and a zip are in:\n     ComfyUI\\output\\seethrough\\\n\nSettings you can change:\n- head_crop_pad (Generate Layers): raise it (0.5 to 0.8) if horns, hats or ears come back cut off.\n- seed: change it to get a slightly different split if a part is missing.\nEverything else is set up already, leave it as is."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
